Author: Deepak kumar <quic_deepaku@quicinc.com>
Date: Tue Nov 19 13:37:15 2024

    opensync: add below  fix and functionality for opensync flow

1. include/uapi/linux/if_tunnel.h 
Add MAP RFC draft03 capability macro to kernel uapi headers
2. br_input.c 
This patch makes bridged ARP, DHCP and ICMPv6 traffic always be passed up
through bridge interface as if promiscuous mode was enabled on that bridge
interface. This allows pcap on said bridge interface to detect this traffic
even if the packet is unicast.
3. net/sched/sch_htb.c
HTB qdisc bandwidth sharing opt for openysnc
4. drivers/net/phy/phy.c
 This changes corrects the incorrect speed status displayed by ethtool when a link is disconnected
5. net/netfilter/Kconfig net/netfilter/Makefile
netfilter-enable-xt-skipaccel for opensync
6. include/linux/skbuff.h 
Add dp-flags to skbuff structure to avoid packet acceleration
7. net/ipv4/netfilter/nf_nat_pptp.c 
Add null check in nat_pptp_info

Signed-off-by: Deepak kumar <quic_deepaku@quicinc.com>
